      "contextBefore": "A publisher which performs upstream operations on the specified scheduler.",
      "contextAfter": "In contrast with [`receive(on:options:)`](publisher/receive(on:options:).md), which affects downstream messages, [`subscribe(on:options:)`](publisher/subscribe(on:options:).md) changes the execution context of upstream messages.",
