    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "In contrast with [`receive(on:options:)`](publisher/receive(on:options:).md), which affects downstream messages, [`subscribe(on:options:)`](publisher/subscribe(on:options:).md) changes the execution context of upstream messages.",
      "normalizedSource": "In contrast with [`receive(on:options:)`](publisher/receive(on:options:).md), which affects downstream messages, [`subscribe(on:options:)`](publisher/subscribe(on:options:).md) changes the execution context of upstream messages.",
      "sourceHash": "78b8d231bd5340d73213856f938b29f8c1abadd9d1f88246b4923da5785b36ae",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "In the following example, the [`subscribe(on:options:)`](publisher/subscribe(on:options:).md) operator causes `ioPerformingPublisher` to receive requests on `backgroundQueue`, while the [`receive(on:options:)`](publisher/receive(on:options:).md) causes `uiUpdatingSubscriber` to receive elements and completion on `RunLoop.main`.",
      "documentTitle": "subscribe(on:options:)",
      "framework": "Combine",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0011",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "In the following example, the [`subscribe(on:options:)`](publisher/subscribe(on:options:).md) operator causes `ioPerformingPublisher` to receive requests on `backgroundQueue`, while the [`receive(on:options:)`](publisher/receive(on:options:).md) causes `uiUpdatingSubscriber` to receive elements and completion on `RunLoop.main`.",
      "normalizedSource": "In the following example, the [`subscribe(on:options:)`](publisher/subscribe(on:options:).md) operator causes `ioPerformingPublisher` to receive requests on `backgroundQueue`, while the [`receive(on:options:)`](publisher/receive(on:options:).md) causes `uiUpdatingSubscriber` to receive elements and completion on `RunLoop.main`.",
      "sourceHash": "b67146276412f2c2edffd4edd74ed2a839af8c2279b07376d9952e4a78cb102d",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "In contrast with [`receive(on:options:)`](publisher/receive(on:options:).md), which affects downstream messages, [`subscribe(on:options:)`](publisher/subscribe(on:options:).md) changes the execution context of upstream messages.",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nlet ioPerformingPublisher == // Some publisher.\nlet uiUpdatingSubscriber == // Some subscriber that updates the UI.\n\nioPerformingPublisher\n    .subscribe(on: backgroundQueue)\n    .receive(on: RunLoop.main)\n    .subscribe(uiUpdatingSubscriber)\n```",
      "documentTitle": "subscribe(on:options:)",
      "framework": "Combine",
